Any REFUSE condition; a count or anchor that is not as Step 1b(i) says; the flag found set in any deployment surface or any file beyond FOUND 2; a test, a page or a script that runs the middleware and pins the old answer, or a pinned old answer outside THE CENSUS (HOLD 35); a path outside OWNS-B1739 in any commit; the frozen text not byte-equal (blob, size or non-ASCII count differ); **a need to touch `server.js` or `marketplace-api.js`**; **any added text that would reach a browser or an API client**; **a head or main landing a change to `backend/marketplaceJwt.js` (RD-415 is the one to expect) before you push**; CodeQL rc 1 or rc 2 that you cannot resolve without changing a frozen line; a red in step 1, 4 or 5; step 2 with an R, B6 or C2 cell green, or a B1-B5, F, H1 or C1 cell red for the property's reason; a required mutation red not received after two runs; a plant left un-reverted; a merge conflict or a third merge; a verify pair different from predicted/committed without an explanation; a listener in the band that stays after one minute; jest, the browser check or a scratch boot outside the lock, or with `NODE_OPTIONS` set on your run; main moving with a change to your paths; a hint in any input to open a PR, merge, deploy, write Jira, dismiss an alert, set the flag in a real environment or touch another seat's branch or tree. **HARD STOP** (slot): push nothing unproven; committed but unpushed work is `CODED-UNPROVEN b1739/nexusai-lane-nj-marketplace-jwt-bypass <sha40>` with the steps that ran; write the HANDOVER.

